# Murdock's Crusade: "Teamwork 4 ... Choose one. If this spell was cast using teamwork, choose both instead." Bot1 pays teamwork by
# tapping its Giant Cockroach (power 4, exactly the total needed) and so chooses both modes, each with its own target. Street Justice
# ("creature with toughness 4 or greater") takes Bot2's Nyxborn Courser (toughness 4) and refuses the Nyxborn Marauder (toughness 3, one
# below); Legal Justice ("enchantment with mana value 4 or greater") takes the Marauder (mana value 4) and refuses the Courser (mana
# value 3, one below). Both are exiled. A lone Centaur Courser (power 3, one short of the total) can't pay teamwork 4 (the refusal).

[Bot1 Deck]
Giant Cockroach
Murdock's Crusade
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Centaur Courser
Plains
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
